      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.92,
      "end_seconds": 111.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "no you know nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.47,
      "end_seconds": 133.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.07,
      "end_seconds": 162.82,
      "duration_seconds": 27.75,
      "text": "I I have asthma for two years i told my wife I'd come today it's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it i've had migraines yes i took the morning off to come in today um uh I've had eczema yes i kept putting it off which I know isn't sensible"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.39,
      "end_seconds": 170.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "understood alright, migraines, that matches what I have here have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.45,
      "end_seconds": 187.78,
      "duration_seconds": 13.33,
      "text": "hmm uh there was some antibiotic I was told I was allergic but I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.54,
      "end_seconds": 192.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "A A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.94,
      "end_seconds": 213.54,
      "duration_seconds": 19.6,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.88,
      "end_seconds": 216.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.13,
      "end_seconds": 220.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "No not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.19,
      "end_seconds": 223.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.96,
      "end_seconds": 231.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "my father has Parkinson's disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.27,
      "end_seconds": 253.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.44,
      "end_seconds": 268.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "Um, I take Asthalin inhaler, when needed. I take something called prop... propranolol, 40 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.73,
      "end_seconds": 272.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.29,
      "end_seconds": 278.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "No it's at home. I'm on hydrocortisone cream when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 279.18,
      "end_seconds": 286.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Here are the numbers doctor. Pulse is 83 beats a minute respiratory rate 18 BP is 109 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.88,
      "end_seconds": 291.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
