      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.63,
      "end_seconds": 296.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.94,
      "end_seconds": 299.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "yes that's fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.13,
      "end_seconds": 303.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.91,
      "end_seconds": 323.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "The whites of your eyes are yellow and the liver edge is tender under the right ribs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.03,
      "end_seconds": 342.11,
      "duration_seconds": 13.08,
      "text": "You can relax now. Taking everything into account, my working impression is an acute viral hepatitis. I can't rule out gallstones blocking the bile duct yet. Any scans or blood work done already?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.42,
      "end_seconds": 352.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "I had liver blood tests done at another clinic last year i don't have the report with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.21,
      "end_seconds": 379.87,
      "duration_seconds": 25.66,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a hepatitis screen for jaundice i'll request an ultrasound of the liver it'll help with jaundice no alcohol at all and avoid paracetamol and and other painkillers unless we say and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit so we can settle the dose come back after the results"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.75,
      "end_seconds": 381.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.71,
      "end_seconds": 385.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Does all of that make sense?"
    },
